\description{
VirtualDairyHerdR generates biologically realistic synthetic dairy herd
datasets for teaching statistics, data wrangling, visualisation, and machine
learning in agricultural and precision livestock farming contexts.

It is part of the \href{https://github.com/VincentTennanty/Farmaverse}{Farmaverse}
— an open ecosystem of R livestock simulation packages inspired by the
\href{https://pharmaverse.org/}{pharmaverse}.
}
